caption: GATES Setting Rules — GATES Source Boundary
technology-rule: gates-source-boundary

Ordinary GATES cybernetics may reproduce only non-superscience technology available at their TL or lower. Magical, divine, psionic, Super, Cinematic, alien-metaphysical, or superscience capabilities require explicit access to the appropriate source. Paying character points does not by itself make an unsupported technology possible.
